config BR2_PACKAGE_KESTREL_NATIVE
	bool "Kestrel native Ascent boot runtime"
	depends on BR2_FPVOS_BOARD_ASCENT_VRX
	help
	  Install a static, read-only Kestrel runtime and boot
	  supervisor.
	  First create the SquashFS image with kestrel-gnd's
	  tools/package_ascent.py, then supply its absolute path as
	  KESTREL_NATIVE_IMAGE when invoking make. The firmware
	  package includes the runtime; no host or SD application
	  install is needed.
